        "created_at": "2022-08-08T03:03:54.119Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thanks the GTG staff for a great experience! I played the Be a Hero session at Gen Con (this year as Tachyon), and we had time to move into the second scenario, which left us all on a cliffhanger!</p>\n<p>Are the Starter Set scenarios still available in print (apart from the secondary market), or only as pdfs?</p>",
