        "created_at": "2022-08-08T13:11:59.645Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I believe they’ve said fairly recently that they were sold out a while ago necessitating a second print run. <em>However</em>, they’re also taking this opportunity to fix typos and update them to more accurately reflect the official rules (the core book being a few years away from being done when the Starter Kit first came out).</p>",
